message: "If COAST contributes to published work, please cite the article below."
title: "COAST: Coastal Overtopping Analysis and Simulation Toolkit"
abstract: >-
  A Streamlit application that automates the whole OpenFOAM pipeline for wave
  overtopping simulations on coastal structures, from parametric geometry and
  mesh generation through to event-by-event post-processing.
type: software
version: "1.0"
